  "title": "Infrastructure for AI: Deploying a Production-Ready Foundation",
  "description": "AI workloads do not just change applications; they change what infrastructure needs to deliver. This session uses a practical demo to show how to provision and prepare an environment for AI-enabled applications, with attention to scalability, observability, resilience, and operational readiness. The aim is to make infrastructure strategy visible through a concrete example.\n\nSeating for this session is first-come, first-served. Add it to your schedule to plan your day and arrive early to secure a spot.",
